---
description: Code quality standards for labs and scripts
globs:
  - "labs/**/*"
  - "scripts/**/*"
  - "**/*.{py,go,java,ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Match existing language conventions in each directory.

Labs and scripts must include:
- clear README instructions
- automated tests where applicable
- no hardcoded secrets
- reproducible setup

Run appropriate linters before submitting changes (Ruff for Python, ESLint for TypeScript).
